---
// DisclaimerBanner.astro — Legal disclaimer shown between hero and tool
---

<div class="disclaimer-banner" role="note" aria-label="Privacy and legal notice">
  <div class="flex gap-3 items-start">
    <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 18 18" fill="none" aria-hidden="true" class="shrink-0 mt-0.5">
      <path d="M14.5 7.5V6C14.5 2.96 12.04 0.5 9 0.5C5.96 0.5 3.5 2.96 3.5 6V7.5M2 7.5H16V16C16 16.83 15.33 17.5 14.5 17.5H3.5C2.67 17.5 2 16.83 2 16V7.5Z" stroke="var(--color-teal)" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
      <circle cx="9" cy="12.5" r="1.5" fill="var(--color-teal)"/>
    </svg>
    <div>
      <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed" style="color:var(--color-ink-muted);max-width:none;">
        <strong style="color:var(--color-ink);">100% Private &amp; Secure.</strong> Your data never leaves your device. This tool generates a legally sound first draft directly in your browser. While it uses standard Indian legal formats, it is not a substitute for formal legal advice. Always have a registered advocate review your final document before filing in court.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
